    <!-- English fallback -->
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_PANTHEON_FALLBACK_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Reserve Pantheon Beliefs</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_PANTHEON_FALLBACK_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Adds 12 reserve pantheon beliefs, shown only when all regular choices are taken. Prevents large civilization rosters from exhausting the pool. Enabled by default; disable to use only existing beliefs.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_SATELLITE_SAFE_MODE_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Satellite Safe Mode</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_SATELLITE_SAFE_MODE_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Keeps the Earth Satellite project and science victory progress, while skipping instant full-map exploration to investigate large-map crashes. Disabled by default. If incremental exploration is also enabled, the map is revealed over multiple turns.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_SATELLITE_CHUNKED_MODE_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Incremental Satellite Exploration</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_SATELLITE_CHUNKED_MODE_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Reveals the map over multiple turns after completing Earth Satellite, avoiding a single full-map operation. Disabled by default; replaces the original instant exploration when enabled.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_SATELLITE_CHUNK_SIZE_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Satellite Plot Limit per Turn</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_SATELLITE_CHUNK_SIZE_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Maximum plots checked per game turn, shared by all satellite exploration tasks. Default: 500; maximum: 10000. Already explored plots also count. Applies only to incremental satellite exploration.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_NATURAL_WONDER_SAFE_MODE_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Natural Wonder Safe Mode</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_NATURAL_WONDER_SAFE_MODE_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Skips the discovery movie, camera animation and temporary visibility lock when finding a natural wonder, to investigate frozen discovery screens. Keeps discovery events. Disabled by default.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_DEBUG_TIMING_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Stability Performance Timing</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_DEBUG_TIMING_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Logs diagnostic scan times and city/unit counts every 5 turns to inspect turn performance. Disabled by default.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_CLIMATE_DIAGNOSTICS_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Climate and Sea Level Diagnostics</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_CLIMATE_DIAGNOSTICS_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Logs climate level, first observed sea level events, the next sea level rise and submerged plot counts each turn. Records diagnostics without changing climate or the map. Disabled by default.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_SNAPSHOT_OBJECT_BUDGET_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Diagnostic Object Scan Limit</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_SNAPSHOT_OBJECT_BUDGET_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Maximum combined city and unit objects checked per stability diagnostic scan. Default: 10000; maximum: 100000. Stops at the limit and marks the statistics incomplete.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_RESERVE_GROWTH_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>City growth rate +10%. A reserve belief available after regular pantheon choices are exhausted.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_GMS_RESERVE_BORDER_DESC" Language="en_US">
